  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;so plotting we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/924c118f-9058-4099-9f23-f896255d8fd6-Capture.PNG\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 149px;\" /></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;on plotting the diagram we get,</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b0a0c222-779d-4770-b490-97b4ca7fcb50-Capture1.PNG\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 139px;\" /></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now combine diagram of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/23f41058-595a-47a6-bc76-7b2f5099d853-Capture.PNG\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 215px;\" /></p><p>Now combining all diagram we get,</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1ba02c8c-baf0-4a3f-abc4-013fd97113fa-Capture1.PNG\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 320px;\" /></p><p>Hence</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></math></p><p>Now for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;putting the value in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>",
